Subject: [PATCH 10/22] nomadnet: LXMF/pages node (opt-in)

Add the python-lxmf and python-nomadnet recipes and bump python-urwid to
2.6.16 (nomadnet floor), selecting its wcwidth and typing_extensions imports.
S83nomadnet runs the LXMF/pages node but is disabled by default via
/etc/rnsbox/nomadnet.conf.
